# Install as /etc/newme/meta-ids-export.env (root:root, chmod 600). The token value is generated on the
# server (for example `openssl rand -hex 32`) and is the SAME value as META_IDS_EXPORT_TOKEN in the app's
# runtime environment. Never commit the real value.
META_IDS_EXPORT_TOKEN=
# META_IDS_EXPORT_URL=https://app.newme.ae/api/export/meta-ids
# META_IDS_NAS_DIR=/newme-os-backup/exports
# META_IDS_KEEP_DAYS=60
